    #       V1 a dataValidations holding one type="none" validation on A1, the
    #          sample's first cell: the overlap message;
    #       V2 the same validation on D1, the control for V1: exit 0, its line;
    #       V3 two empty <dataValidations/>: the two-container message;
    #       V4 one empty <dataValidations/>, the control for V3: exit 0, its
    #          line.
    # Each refusal: exit 2, the error line exactly the message the committed
    # source holds, no stdout, no output file. Then the messages of this phase,
    # read from the source by constant name, compared as SETS with those reached
    # here and those the log states unreachable, with the reason for each; and
    # usage shapes.
    #
    # CARRIED TO M2 part 4b P1 from M2 part 4a P3's negative script (printed in
    # records/logs/m2p4a-p3/negative.log; its change list P to U is there), with
    # part 4a P4's status-pattern control (records/logs/m2p4a-p4/negative.log).
