    #      part 4a close-out record:"); the doc commit and the three code
    #      commits by their full P1 subjects. This script lives on the disk in
    #      the phase's scripts directory under the home directory's
    #      .cache/emend-build/m2p4b-p1, shown as <scripts>, with its standard
    #      error in <scripts>/out. The gate's log and build directory default to
    #      records/logs/m2p4b-p1/gate.log and the phase's gate directory; both
    #      are labelled input lines.
    #  AD. The family is P1's V0 to V4 above, the generator gen-v.py editing the
    #      template's worksheet right after its empty sheetData.
    #  AE. The messages of this phase are the constants from NO_AREA to
    #      TWO_VALIDATIONS in the source, read by constant name, each checked
    #      non-empty, and that set compared with the reached and the
    #      stated-unreachable ones.
    #  AF. The spec. The log pins the COMMITTED spec: the blob at the phase
    #      commit (the P1 doc commit's) at
    #      dc4cb48509becb9d2c93f7e6e728f85151666f950feb9e154d096ca816c34bbe.
    #      The working file differs: it holds planning's uncommitted "Planning
