    #      and never asserted, and the status pattern allows that one line
    #      (" M specs/0020-..."). Each message is looked for in both copies:
    #      every message must stand in the working copy (the fifteenth, "a
    #      validation field does not apply to its kind", comes from P1 ruling 1
